      ],
      "source": "https://www.rfcity.org/177/History-of-River-Falls",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1893 a lightning strike hit a circus pole during a Ringling Brothers show, killing seven and injuring many.",
